! Original Dolch palettes: Renzhi Li (Belleve Invis). https://github.com/be5invis/vscode-theme-dolch
! Tide retains upstream Blue primitives; Ember uses original Alter custom ramps with the shared Blue base. Dusk, Viridian, Bloom and the application mappings are Solai studies.

! Solai Dusk Light — xterm resources; does not affect other X applications.
XTerm*background: #F1F0F4
XTerm*foreground: #2D2C2F
XTerm*cursorColor: #453E80
XTerm*highlightColor: #C5C2D7
XTerm*highlightTextColor: #2D2C2F
XTerm*highlightColorMode: true
XTerm*color0: #1C1B1E
XTerm*color1: #AC413A
XTerm*color2: #00753A
XTerm*color3: #766300
XTerm*color4: #0068B9
XTerm*color5: #99448C
XTerm*color6: #007790
XTerm*color7: #BBBABD
XTerm*color8: #656568
XTerm*color9: #9C2D2A
XTerm*color10: #00652A
XTerm*color11: #655400
XTerm*color12: #005AAC
XTerm*color13: #8A317E
XTerm*color14: #006882
XTerm*color15: #E8E8EB
